			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Imagine your database is one server. If it goes down, your app\ngoes down. Also, if millions of users hit it, it gets slow.",
			"rawText": "Imagine your database is one server. If it goes down, your app goes down. Also, if millions of users hit it, it gets slow.",
